# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

## [beta-0.0.54] - 2025-08-25

[Release details](https://gitlab.com/SuperT0f/react-fantasy-chess/-/releases/0.0.54)
### Added
- Enhanced AI with iterative deepening and aggressive mode options
- Pawn promotion feature with modal selection interface
- New logging system with multiple verbosity levels and chess board visualization
- Graveyard component showing captured pieces and point differential
- Burger menu for theme selection accessibility
- Multiple new themes: classic, first-blood, hanna, mystical, mystical-hd
- Move history component with PGN notation
- Victory message component for game end states
- Timer display with low-time warnings

### Changed
- **Major refactor**: Centralized game logic in Referee class for consistent validation
- Improved move validation for all piece types
- Enhanced check and checkmate detection logic
- Restructured project with better component separation
- Updated UI with responsive design improvements
- AI now auto-promotes pawns to queens during moves
- Improved en passant capture handling

### Fixed
- Fixed isCheck() detection in various edge cases
- Resolved pawn move validation issues
- Corrected castling logic and validation
- Fixed stalemate detection using referee methods
- Addressed various move simulation issues

### Technical
- Added comprehensive unit tests for pawn movement
- Implemented Makefile helpers for development workflow
- Enhanced error handling throughout the codebase
- Improved performance with optimized move validation
- Added detailed debug logging capabilities


### Refactor
- Split game and board logic into separate components and hooks
- Refactored entity and base entity classes for better organization

## [2025-08-20] - Version 0.0.42

### Features
- **Graveyard System**: Added captured piece tracking with point differential display
- **UI Improvements**: Enhanced Burger menu and timer styling
- **AI Enhancements**: Better move logic and validation systems
- **Architecture**: Introduced MoveData class for consistent move handling

### Technical
- Split codebase into more modular structure
- Created new components and hooks for better separation of concerns

## [2025-08-19] - Version 0.0.23

### Features
- **Castling**: Implemented complete castling logic with king and rook movement
- **PGN Notation**: Enhanced move recording with castle notation support
- **Referee System**: Added comprehensive game referee for state management
- **Theme Default**: Set default theme to 'mystical-hd'

### Fixes
- Improved error logging for missing entity images
- Added Opera browser launch configuration

## [2025-08-18] - Version 0.0.15

### Major Features
- **Classic Theme**: Added new classic chess theme
- **PGN System**: Complete PGN notation implementation with move counting
- **Move Highlighting**: Visual indicators for last moves
- **Check Detection**: Implemented isCheck validation for moves

### UI/UX
- **Fantasy Logo**: Improved logo design and visual appeal
- **Move Suggestions**: Separate styles for player and opponent valid moves
- **Selected Square**: Enhanced visual feedback for selected pieces

## [2025-08-17] - Version 0.0.9

### Core Features
- **Theming System**: Multiple themes (mystical, mystical-hd, first-blood, hanna)
- **Timer System**: Countdown timer with visual warnings
- **Victory Conditions**: Checkmate, stalemate, and timeout handling
- **AI Foundation**: Basic AI with random moves and opening book
- **Game Modes**: Player vs Player and Player vs AI options

### Technical
- **Entity System**: Complete chess piece logic implementation
- **Move Validation**: Comprehensive move validation with check prevention
- **En Passant**: Fixed en passant move handling and PGN notation

## [2025-08-16] - Version 0.0.7

### Initial Release
- **Basic Chess Game**: Complete chess functionality
- **Piece Movement**: All chess pieces with proper movement rules
- **Board System**: Interactive chess board with visual feedback
- **Theme Support**: Multiple visual themes
- **Responsive Design**: Mobile-friendly interface

### Infrastructure
- **Build System**: Makefile with development and production commands
- **Versioning**: Automated version bump system
- **CI/CD**: GitLab CI configuration for SAST
- **Documentation**: Comprehensive README and project structure

## Earlier Development (2025-08-05 to 2025-08-15)

- Project initialization and foundation
- Basic React setup and component structure
- Core chess logic implementation
- Asset creation and theme development
- Initial AI experimentation

